# Institute CMS conventions

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root for stack, commands, and fee rules.

## Must preserve

- Save as Paid → settle oldest open invoices; remainder / no dues → `source: 'advance'`.
- One user payment → one `paymentBatchId` / one Payments history line.
- Student “Payments received this month” → group by **paidAt** (local calendar month); merge batches.
- Inactive academic sessions → year closed (pending 0 for display); do not treat prior-year dues as live pending after promotion.
- Fee month table carry-forward (Prev. due / Month due / Balance); settled prior months green.
- Do not blank full pages on refresh; use silent reload patterns already in list/detail views.
- Keep Create invoice on `DraggableDialog` (wide enough; select/picker z-index above dialog).

## Session continuity

Prior chat exports: `docs/session-history/`. Prefer continuing from project rules + that history over inventing new fee behavior.
